<div id="urduTextPath">امام حسن (ع)/جس دم حسن کا زہر سے ٹکڑے جگر ہوا</div>

<p>jis dam hassan ka zaher se tukde jigar huwa<br />
saipaara dil ka aaho'n se ze-ro- zabar huwa<br />
sam ka jo roo-e- paak pa zaahir asar huwa<br />
haal us imam-e- paak ka is dam digar huwa</p>

<p>raahat me farq aur shikam me qalal pada<br />
kat kar kaleja tasht ke andar nikal pada<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bistar pa dard-e- dil se tadapne lage imam<br />
sadme se sabz hone laga rooe surq faam<br />
chillaye haath se ye kaleje ko thaam thaam<br />
doudo bahan ke kaam hamara huwa tamam</p>

<p>ye kehte kehte zard ruq-e- paak hogaya<br />
chillate the ke haye jigar chaak hogaya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>doudhi'n janab-e- zainab-e bekas barahna pa<br />
dekha ke lot-te hai bichone pa mujtaba<br />
boli ye sar ko peet ke wo gham ki mubtela<br />
hai hai bahan nisar ho bhai ye kya huwa</p>

<p>kya phir kisi ne zeher dagha se piladiya<br />
kis ne mere kaleje pe khanjar chala diya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>takya laga rahe the haram jo idhar udhar<br />
baazu ko thaam leti ,thi koi to koi sar<br />
farmaya laao tasht, huwa zeher ka asar<br />
reh reh ke koi kaat'ta hai tegh se jigar</p>

<p>badhta tha jab ke dard jigar me imaam ke<br />
jhukte the baar baar kaleje ko thaam ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zainab ne jald laake rakha samne lagan<br />
hathou'n se dil pakad ke jhuke sarwar-e- zaman<br />
aayi jo qai to kaane jawaahar bana dahan<br />
almaas khake laal ugalne lage hassan</p>

<p>range zamroodi ka asar ab ayaa'n huwa<br />
meraaj ki hadees ka matlab ayaa'n huwa<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>farmate the hassan ke bulaao hussain ko<br />
tha dambadam ye hukm, ke laao hussain ko<br />
bhaai ka haale zaar sunaao hussain ko<br />
tukde mere jigar ke dikhao hussain ko</p>

<p>kehdo ke jald aaiye rehlat ka waqt hai<br />
sun jaiye kuch aake wasiyat ka waqt hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aaye hussain itne me baa chashm ashkbaar<br />
chillate the ke aapki ghurbath ke mai nisaar<br />
shabbar gale ko choom ke kehte the baar baar<br />
mai tum pa sadqe aye mere nana ke yaadgaar</p>

<p>mujh se ziyada zulm-o- sitam tum pa hoyenge<br />
ham qabr me tumhari musibath pa royenge<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bhaiyya tumhari god me niklega mera dam<br />
tum doge hamko ghusl-o- kafan jab marenge ham<br />
hoga tumhare paas na koi bajuz alam<br />
qatil sarhane hoyega ya khanjar-e- sitam</p>

<p>shabbar to baad-e marg bhi raahat se soyega<br />
laasha tumhara ghodou'n se pamaal hoyega<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bole katora leke hussain-e falak janaab<br />
dekhu to peeke mai bhi ke kis tarha ka hai aab<br />
bhai se lipti doud ke zainab jigar kabaab<br />
pakda hassan ne daste baradar basad shitaab</p>

<p>jaldi se pee na le ye qalaq tha imam par<br />
ek haath tha kaleje pa ek haath jaam par<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>darde jigar se ghash huwe shaah-e- falak janaab<br />
ghamgee'n to the hussain huwa aur izteraab<br />
haazir thi rooh-e ahmed-o- zehra o- buturaab<br />
wa aasmaa'n pe hogaye baagh-e- jinaa'n ke baab</p>

<p>sar peeto momino ke khazaa kar gaye hassan<br />
bin bhai ke hussain huwe margaye hassan<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>barpa tha ahle bait-e-payambar me shor-o shain<br />
behne pachade'n qhaak pa khaati thi karke bain<br />
chaati pe haath maarke chillate the hussain<br />
ab uth gaya zamane se ham bekasou'n ka chain</p>

<p>dil ab hamara toot gaya wa musibata<br />
baap aaj hamse choot gaya wa musibata<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ek ek ko rokte the imam-e- falak sareer<br />
aane lage janaze pa jo us taraf se teer<br />
kaanpi zameen hilgaya sadme se charqe peer<br />
nikli lahad se fatima jebe- kafan ko cheer</p>

<p>taboot par nawase ke bid'at jo hoti thi<br />
roohe rasoole paak janaze pa roti thi</p>